meta {
  name: 2 over threshold skips unready
  seq: 2
}

docs {
  Attendee orders one item within the baseline hold, then a larger order that
  exceeds it. The overage hold is created (402), confirmed on Stripe, and
  authorized via webhook. Because the overage items are not marked ready,
  organizer checkout skips the tab and does not release the holds.
}
